{"seq":1,"slug":"lint-and-format-in-the-ai-age","title":"Lint And Format In The Ai Age","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/lint-and-format-in-the-ai-age","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"automated-guardrails-vs-manual-review","title":"自动护栏胜过人工机械检查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/lint-and-format-in-the-ai-age/automated-guardrails-vs-manual-review","wordCount":3073,"readingTime":13},{"seq":2,"slug":"what-lint-and-format-do-for-agents","title":"Lint 与格式化为 Agent 做了什么","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/lint-and-format-in-the-ai-age/what-lint-and-format-do-for-agents","wordCount":2861,"readingTime":12},{"seq":3,"slug":"deterministic-style-frees-attention","title":"确定的风格解放注意力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/lint-format-as-agent-guardrails/lint-and-format-in-the-ai-age/deterministic-style-frees-attention","wordCount":3092,"readingTime":13}],"introHtml":"<p>本章讲清为什么在 AI 时代 lint 和格式化的价值被放大:当 agent 大量产出代码,机械的检查(风格、低级问题、一致性)靠人逐条抓既跟不上也没必要——自动护栏胜过人工的机械检查;lint 和格式化具体为 agent 做了三件事(抓真问题、统一约定、确定的格式);而确定的、由机器统一的风格,把人和 agent 的注意力从&quot;格式对不对&quot;解放到&quot;逻辑对不对、意图对不对&quot;这些真正需要判断的地方。</p>\n"}